hes so we've planted them along the road on trellises, on cattle panel arches in the market garden, in our garlic field, and o...","slug":"edge-of-liberty-craft-fair---september-18-2022","featuredImage":"https://web.archive.org/web/20231002153033/https://img1.wsimg.com/isteam/ip/5c0d4bf0-4792-4184-8c0d-5227a17a1b3a/septcollage.jpeg","categories":["Events","General"],"featureFlags":{"commenting":false,"resellerRssToEmail":false,"rssToEmail":false,"showCategories":true,"showSocial":true,"socialPlatforms":[]},"publishedDate":"2022-09-18T11:33:05.040Z","fullContent":"{\"blocks\":[{\"key\":\"1ak8h\",\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"atomic\",\"depth\":0,\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"entityRanges\":[{\"offset\":0,\"length\":1,\"key\":0}],\"data\":{}},{\"key\":\"4kf7k\",\"text\":\"Fall is in the air and we've got pumpkins everywhere!  We absolutely adore edible winter squashes so we've planted them along the road on trellises, on cattle panel arches in the market garden, in our garlic field, and on an incredible hundred-foot-long serpent-mound hugelkultur.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\",\"depth\":0,\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"entityRanges\":[],\"data\":{}},{\"key\":\"d1s5k\",\"text\":\"All of our pumpkins are for eating, not decorating, but if you're looking for decor, self-pampering items, and gifts, our craft fair vendors will have you covered at our penultimate craft fair of the season.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\",\"depth\":0,\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"entityRanges\":[],\"data\":{}},{\"key\":\"f7dni\",\"text\":\"We have fifteen crafters and artisans joining us on Sunday, September 18 on what should be a glorious fall day for the fifth of the six craft fairs we have scheduled for 2022. Come out and enjoy a lovely walk through nature, do some shopping, and grab some fresh picked goodness from our farm stand.  \",\"type\":\"unstyled\",\"depth\":0,\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"entityRanges\":[],\"data\":{}},{\"key\":\"2jt5o\",\"text\":\"While you're here, take a leisurely walk around the entire property and learn how we've improved the soil through regenerative agriculture practices, revel in the beauty of intentional plantings next to spontaneous wildflowers feeding native pollinators, check out the coolest compost bin in Porter County, and see our solar well pump in action watering all of our gardens and keeping our pond full to support an amazing variety of wildlife. \",\"type\":\"unstyled\",\"depth\":0,\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"entityRanges\":[],\"data\":{}},{\"key\":\"97ds4\",\"text\":\"We hope you will join us and be part of our community!\",\"type\":\"unstyled\",\"depth\":0,\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"entityRanges\":[],\"data\":{}},{\"key\":\"4prqv\",\"text\":\"Read all the details about our vendors and their amazing products below.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\",\"depth\":0,\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"entityRanges\":[],\"data\":{}},{\"key\":\"4qunj\",\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"atomic\",\"depth\":0,\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"entityRanges\":[{\"offset\":0,\"length\":1,\"key\":1}],\"data\":{}},{\"key\":\"d3uss\",\"text\":\"Where are you? (click for map) \",\"type\":\"unstyled\",\"depth\":0,\"inlineStyleRanges\":[{\"offset\":0,\"length\":13,\"style\":\"UNDERLINE\"}],\"entityRanges\":[{\"offset\":0,\"length\":13,\"key\":2}],\"data\":{}},{\"key\":\"c3vuc\",\"text\":\"We're conveniently located on old 49 (Calumet) a mile north of Valparaiso and a mile south of the drive-in theater, right on the edge of Liberty Township.\",\"type\":\"unstyled\",\"depth\":0,\"inlineStyleRanges\":[],\"entityRanges\":[],\"data\":{}},{\"key\":\"4obbi\",\"text\":\"What crafts will be available? (click for gallery) \",\"type\":\"unstyled\",\"depth\":0,\"inlineStyleRanges\":[{\"offset\":0,\"length\":29,\"style\":\"UNDERLINE\"}],\"entityRanges\":[{\"offset\":0,\"length\":29,\"key\":3}],\"data\":{}},{\"key\":\"4iojf\",\"text\":\"Committed vendors for this event and information about their products are detailed below with links to their personal pages. All vendors either accept credit cards pers